#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Reference (shared kernel)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "The terms every context shares: time, codes, geography and the idea of a registry. Changes here affect every context, so they are reviewed by all stewards."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Academic period**: A school year, or a term within it, to which enrolments, postings and results belong. _Avoid_: Session, semester (unless that is the local term)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Reference date**: The date as at which stocks are counted for a collection or an indicator. _Avoid_: Census day, snapshot date, as-of date"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Code list**: A governed, versioned set of allowed values for a coded attribute; a code is retired, never reused or given a new meaning. _Avoid_: Lookup, enum, dropdown"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Crosswalk**: A versioned mapping from a local classification to an international one. _Avoid_: Mapping table, conversion"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Administrative area**: A unit of the versioned administrative geography, such as a district. _Avoid_: Region (unless that is the local term), zone"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Registry**: The single authoritative store of one kind of master record (institutions, sites, persons, posts). _Avoid_: Register, roster, directory, master list"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**External register**: An authoritative list held by another authority, such as a civil register, read through an adapter. _Avoid_: Registry (which is ours), source system"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/reference/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Data subject**: The person a record is about. _Avoid_: Owner, user"
msgstr ""
